<title>ITALY: Telecoms decree on agenda Italy cabinet on Weds.</title>
<headline>Telecoms decree on agenda Italy cabinet on Weds.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A decree concerning the merger of state telecoms holding Stet with its unit Telecom Italia will be on the agenda when Italy's centre-left cabinet meets on Wednesday, a government statement said.</p>
<p>The cabinet will meet at 0715 GMT, it said.</p>
<p>The decree concerns the transfer of the telephone concession from Telecom to Stet as part of the merger, which is due to precede privatisation of the enlarged telecoms entity later this year.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
